OL,3,ADiesel hits #2 a litre in UK for first
OL,4,Atime, RAC says, as US pressures Europe
OL,5,Ato release reserves
OL,6,
OL,7,FAverage UK diesel prices have hit a
OL,8,Frecord high, according to motoring
OL,9,Fgroup the RAC, reaching #2 a litre for
OL,10,Fthe first time - watch BBC coverage
OL,11,Fabove
OL,13,FIt comes as US President Donald Trump
OL,14,Fsays he may ask European countries to
OL,15,Frelease diesel reserves as he considers
OL,16,Fbanning US exports of the fuel
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
