OL,3,ADiesel hits #2 a litre in UK for first
OL,4,Atime, RAC says, as US pressures Europe
OL,5,Ato release reserves
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe move could bring prices down
OL,8,Fsignificantly for American drivers, but
OL,9,Fexperts warn it would put further
OL,10,Fpressure on diesel prices in other
OL,11,Fcountries, as the Iran war continues to
OL,12,Fput pressure on the supply.
OL,14,FTransport Minister Keir Mather says the
OL,15,FUK's supply of diesel is "robust" and
OL,16,F"resilient" and the country has a wide
OL,17,Frange of sources
OL,19,FThe US is a vital supplier of diesel to
OL,20,Fthe world, while more than half of the
OL,21,FUK's diesel is imported, with 31%
OL,22,Fcoming from the US.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
